{
  "canvas": [
    {
      "name": "getCanvas",
      "label": "画布概览",
      "description": "读取激活画布的 ID、节点数、连线数、选中数量和视口；include 可加 canvases 或 nodeTypes 分页列表。不返回全部节点，已知 ID 时直接读取节点。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 256
          },
          "include": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "canvases",
                "nodeTypes"
              ]
            },
            "maxItems": 2
          },
          "cursor": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 4096
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 100
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "findCanvasNodes",
      "label": "查找画布节点",
      "description": "按 query（节点 ID 或完整名称）、types、selectedOnly 筛选节点并分页返回摘要，不含正文。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 256
          },
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 200
          },
          "types": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            },
            "maxItems": 20
          },
          "selectedOnly": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "cursor": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 4096
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 100
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "getCanvasNodes",
      "label": "读取节点详情",
      "description": "按已知且不重复的 nodeIds 读取最多 20 个节点，fields 默认 label/type/position；path 读取嵌套投影值并按偏移分页。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 256
          },
          "nodeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 20
          },
          "fields": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "label",
                "type",
                "position",
                "ports",
                "data",
                "outputs"
              ]
            },
            "maxItems": 6
          },
          "dataKeys": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            },
            "maxItems": 20
          },
          "path": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 256
            },
            "maxItems": 64
          },
          "valueOffset": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "valueLimit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 100
          },
          "textOffset": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "textLimit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 4000
          },
          "cursor": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 4096
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "nodeIds"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "getCanvasEdges",
      "label": "读取画布连线",
      "description": "分页读取 nodeIds 相关连线，direction 取 incoming/outgoing/both；省略 nodeIds 时遍历全图。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 256
          },
          "nodeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 20
          },
          "direction": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "incoming",
              "outgoing",
              "both"
            ]
          },
          "cursor": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 4096
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 200
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "getNodeTools",
      "label": "查询节点函数",
      "description": "按最多 20 个不重复 nodeIds 查询节点实际注册的函数与参数 schema；调用前必须先查询。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 256
          },
          "nodeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 20
          },
          "names": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            },
            "maxItems": 20
          },
          "cursor": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 4096
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 50
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "nodeIds"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addCanvas",
      "label": "新增画布",
      "description": "在当前工作区创建空白画布并切换过去；name 不含 .json，省略时使用未占用的画布N。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 120
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "switchCanvas",
      "label": "切换画布",
      "description": "先分页获取 canvasId 再切换激活画布，返回新画布概览。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 256
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "canvasId"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "renameCanvas",
      "label": "重命名画布",
      "description": "重命名画布并同步文件名，不覆盖已有文件；省略 canvasId 时重命名激活画布。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 256
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 120
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "name"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addNode",
      "label": "新增节点",
      "description": "在激活画布的画布坐标新增节点，type 必须来自 getCanvas 的 availableNodeTypes。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "position": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "x": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "y": {
                "type": "number"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "x",
              "y"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "label": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 200
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "type",
          "position"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "deleteNodes",
      "label": "删除节点",
      "description": "批量删除节点及其连线，任一校验失败整体不执行。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "nodeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 64
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "nodeIds"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "moveNodes",
      "label": "移动节点",
      "description": "批量移动节点到各自画布坐标，任一校验失败整体不执行。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "moves": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 64,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "nodeId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 256
                },
                "position": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "x": {
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    "y": {
                      "type": "number"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "x",
                    "y"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "nodeId",
                "position"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "moves"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "renameNodes",
      "label": "重命名节点",
      "description": "批量修改节点显示名称。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "renames": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 64,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "nodeId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 256
                },
                "label": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 200
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "nodeId",
                "label"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "renames"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "connectNodes",
      "label": "连接节点",
      "description": "批量连接输出端口与输入端口；先用 getCanvasNodes 的 ports 确认端口。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "connections": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 64,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "source": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 256
                },
                "sourceHandle": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "target": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 256
                },
                "targetHandle": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "source",
                "sourceHandle",
                "target",
                "targetHandle"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "connections"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "deleteEdges",
      "label": "删除连线",
      "description": "批量删除指定 edgeIds 的连线。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "edgeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 64
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "edgeIds"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "selectNodes",
      "label": "选择节点",
      "description": "选择指定节点；传空数组取消选择。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "nodeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "nodeIds"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "arrangeCanvas",
      "label": "整理画布",
      "description": "按连线把顶层节点从左到右排列并适应视图，不触发生成。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "fitCanvas",
      "label": "适应画布",
      "description": "调整视口展示指定节点；省略则展示全部。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "nodeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 256
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "nodeTools",
      "label": "调用节点函数",
      "description": "调用节点已注册函数 node:functionName；先 getNodeTools 取完整参数 schema 再填 args。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "nodeId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 256
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^node:[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]{0,63}$"
          },
          "args": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "nodeId",
          "name",
          "args"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "extra": [
    {
      "name": "askQuestion",
      "label": "向用户提问",
      "description": "当缺少必要信息且无法从项目文件推断时，向用户提出一个结构化问题；可给出选项或表单字段。回答会作为工具结果返回。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 200
          },
          "question": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 4000
          },
          "options": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 20,
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 300
            }
          },
          "fields": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 20,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "title",
          "question"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "generateImage",
      "label": "生成图片",
      "description": "用项目已获批的 Qwen 图片模型生成一张图并保存到项目素材；model 取 text（文生图）或 edit（单图编辑，需 referencePath）。单次调用占用且仅占用一个生成名额。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "prompt": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 8000
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text",
              "edit"
            ]
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "1K",
              "0.5MP",
              "2K"
            ]
          },
          "ratio": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "1:1",
              "2:3",
              "3:2",
              "3:4",
              "4:3",
              "9:16",
              "16:9",
              "21:9"
            ]
          },
          "referencePath": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 300
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "prompt"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
